    "transcript": "I THANK MY FRIEND FROM WEST TEXAS AND APPRECIATE SHARING WITH THE COUNTRY AND ALL OF OUR COLLEAGUES THE TESTIMONY OF HIS LITTLE GIRLS AND THEIR CONNECTION TO CAMP MYSTIC AND HE HAS BEEN AN EXTRAORDINARY REPRESENTATIVE OF CAMP MYSTIC AND THOSE CAMPS AND SHOWN GREAT LEADERSHIP HIMSELF AS WE ARE ALL LOOKING FINDING WAYS TO MAKE SURE THESE CAMPS REBUILD AND BEFORE I RECOGNIZE THE NEXT SPEAKER FROM TEXAS, COACH ROGER WILLIAMS, I WANT TO NOTE THAT OUR COLLEAGUE BUDDY CARTER IS IN DALLAS AT A FUNERAL. HE REPRESENTS GEORGIA DOWN NEAR SAVANNAH AND HIS GRAND NIECE IS BEING BURIED IN DALLAS TO SHOW HOW FAR REACHING IT IT. AND HIS GRANDDAUGHTERS WERE AT CAMP MYSTIC AND SURVIVED AND TOUCHING EVERYBODY IN THIS CHAMBER. I YIELD THREE MINUTES TO OUR ESTEEMED COACH AND FRIEND, ROGER WILL QUAMS.",
